"Linked partner (optional). Usually created when converting the lead. You can"
" find a partner by its Name, TIN, Email or Internal Reference."
msgstr ""
"Länkad kontakt (valfri). Oftast skapad när man konverterar en kundämne. Du "
"kan finna en kontakt via dess namn, TIN, mail, eller intern referens."

#. module: crm
